    <!-- Column 2 -->
    <div class="book-entry">
      <img src="placeholder.png" alt="Book Cover" class="book-image">
      <div class="book-details">
        <h3><span data-field="title_8">{{ title_8 }}</span></h3>
        <p>EDITED BY <span data-field="editor_8_name">{{ editor_8_name }}</span></p>
        <p>This book examines the evolving landscape of international environmental law, addressing contemporary challenges such as climate change, biodiversity loss, and pollution. It explores the interplay between international legal frameworks, scientific advancements, and political realities.</p>
        <p><strong>Contents overview:</strong></p>
        <ul class="contents-list">
          <li>Introduction: The state of international environmental law</li>
          <li>Climate change and international law</li>
          <li>Biodiversity and international law</li>
          <li>Pollution and international law</li>
        </ul>
        <p><strong>Contributors:</strong> <span data-field="contributor_8_name">{{ contributor_8_name }}</span>, <span data-field="contributor_8_name">{{ contributor_8_name }}</span>, <span data-field="contributor_8_name">{{ contributor_8_name }}</span></p>
        <p>ISBN: <span data-field="isbn_8">{{ isbn_8 }}</span></p>
        <p>Pages: <span data-field="pages_8">{{ pages_8 }}</span>; Price: <span data-field="price_8">{{ price_8 }}</span></p>
