    <!-- Column 3 -->
    <div class="book-entry">
      <img src="placeholder.png" alt="Book Cover" class="book-image">
      <div class="book-details">
        <h3><span data-field="title_9">{{ title_9 }}</span></h3>
        <p>EDITED BY <span data-field="editor_9_name">{{ editor_9_name }}</span></p>
        <p>This volume addresses the complex political, social, and economic trajectories of Latin America in the 21st century. It examines the challenges of democratic consolidation, inequality, and the impact of global economic shifts on the region.</p>
