          </div>
          <div class="toc-entry">
            <p><strong>Part III:</strong> International assistance for local environmental governance</p>
          </div>
          <div class="toc-entry">
            <p><strong>Part IV:</strong> Regional approaches to economic integration and environmental governance</p>
          </div>
          <div class="toc-entry">
            <p><strong>Part V:</strong> Hybrid Systems in Environmental Governance</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
