  <div style="clear: both;"></div>
  <div class="content-section" style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>"East Asia is turning into a key region in the world, in terms of both accelerating environmental problems and innovative environmental reform. This very timely and up-to-date volume contains in-depth analyses of the successes and challenges of contemporary environmental governance in various East Asian countries and on multiple topics. Through a large number of detailed and fascinating studies, from multiple perspectives, a unique understanding is offered on how national, regional and international policies, strategies and measures contribute to sustainable development."</p>
