        <h1 style="font-size: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 10px;">LOCAL COMMONS AND DEMOCRATIC ENVIRONMENTAL GOVERNANCE</h1>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.2em;"></h2>
        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
          <img src="placeholder_cover.png" alt="Cover" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
