        <h1 style="font-size: 1.5em; margin-bottom: 10px;">EXCORCISING THE DEMONS WITHIN</h1>
        <h2 style="font-size: 1.2em;">Xenophobia, Violence and Statecraft in Contemporary South Africa</h2>
        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
          <img src="placeholder_cover.png" alt="Cover" style="width: 150px; height: auto;">
          <p style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.9em;">EDITED BY <span data-field="editor_name">{{ editor_name }}</span></p>
        </div>
